// 02_Fundamental_Data_Types: Size, range, and behavior of standard types: char, int, float, double.
// 03_Type_Modifiers: Altering data ranges and properties using signed, unsigned, short, and long.
// 04_Fixed_Width_Integer_Types: Using modern portable standards from <stdint.h> (e.g., uint32_t, int16_t).
// 05_Constants_and_Literals: Defining immutable values via #define, const, hexadecimals (0x), octals (0), and binaries (0b).